  "document": "Pilot (Preacher)\n\"Pilot\" is the series premiere of the supernatural drama television series \"Preacher\", which originally aired on AMC in the United States on May 22, 2016. The episode was written by the creators of the television adaptation, Seth Rogen, Evan Goldberg and Sam Catlin; with both Rogen and Goldberg directing. The pilot encore was followed by \"Talking Preacher\", AMC's after-show hosted by Chris Hardwick."
